  "albumInformation": "<p>MUL / DIV is my newest album, which I am currently working on. I am releasing each song one-by-one as they are finished.</p>\n<p>I hope that when you listen to this album, you can relax, let your imagination go wherever it may go, and that you can feel something when you hear the songs.</p>\n<p>The cover image is a derivative work of \"Dandelion by Bruno Bastos, which is released under a Creative Commons Attribution 2.0 License. Changes include cropping, coloration, and addition of titles. The original is available at https://www.flickr.com/photos/128930497@N03/22190242684</p>",
